Subject: [PATCH 2/4] sh-pfc: Add emev2 pinmux support
Date: Fri, 12 Dec 2014 21:01:35 +0100
Message-Id: <1418414497-23741-3-git-send-email-niso@kth.se>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.1.3
In-Reply-To: <1418414497-23741-1-git-send-email-niso@kth.se>
